151 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 152 0 R/Alt(Twin-axis line plot on a symlog sigma axis: hidden E rate (black diamonds, left axis) rises monotonically from about 9 Hz to 66 Hz as cycle-coherent jitter sigma grows, while test accuracy (red squares, right axis) declines gently from about 91 to 82 percent. A grey line shows the realised mean I rate: flat near 53 Hz up to about sigma 14 ms, then drooping to about 40 Hz by sigma 100 ms.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[1]/Pg 229 0 R>>
